          "type": "text",
          "text": "A pie chart of 180 students has a sector of 108° for cycling. A pictogram of the cycling students in two classes has 5.5 icons for Class A and 4 icons for Class B, and each icon represents 4 students. How many cycling students come from the remaining class? Enter the numerical value only."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 4,
      "primary_outcome": "1.2",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
        "comparison_mode": "exact_numeric",
        "canonical_answer": "16",
